  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 604.02 General Design Requirements. A composting facility shall be designed to operate in conformance with Env-Sw 605.\n\nSource. #5172, eff 7-1-91; ss by #6535, INTERIM, eff 7-1-97, EXPIRES: 10-29-97; ss by #6619-B, eff 10-29-97; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 600); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 2304.02); ss by #10596, eff 7-1-14; ss by #13358, eff 4-1-22",
